  "NIntegrate", "eincr", 
   "\"The global error of the strategy GlobalAdaptive has increased more than \
\\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"2000\\\"}]\\) times. The global error is expected to \
decrease monotonically after a number of integrand evaluations. Suspect one \
